<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - fine and hot, max 29 degrees C.</title>
<headline>HK weather - fine and hot, max 29 degrees C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>It will be fine and hot with one or two showers, the Royal Observatory said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Maximum temperature will reach about 29 degrees celsius.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 25 C and the relative humidity 89 per cent, the observatory said.</p>
<p>Showers are expected on Wednesday, it said.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843-6441</p>
